      "value": "@{68098a4626271974ef4d2775|full_name}\n\nThis won't help when some people won't or can't move to order instance or when moving to other instance may disrupt whatever is already going on (for example a game which progress is tied to the instance).\n\nMostly this should be meant for cases when someone crashes and want to rejoin.\n\nAlso for invite instance, you need to be friend with everyone.",
